message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "GeoAI-VLM: Geospatial Vision-Language Model Analysis"
abstract: "Geospatial vision-language model analysis for street-level imagery. Downloads Mapillary images by location, describes them with open vision-language models through Transformers, vLLM or any OpenAI-compatible endpoint, embeds and clusters them, and turns image observations into street-segment indicators with coverage, recency and evaluation tools."
